  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> be any two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;symmetric and skew symmetric matrices respectively. Then which of the following is <strong>NOT&nbsp;</strong>true?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "hsaMT",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math> is a symmetric matrix",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TVfek",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math> is a symmetric matrix",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mUt1M",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math> is a skew-symmetric matrix",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AIVw0",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math> is a skew-symmetric matrix",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>Now solving all option one by one we get,</p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;option&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is a symmetric matrix</p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;option&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is a symmetric matrix</p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;option&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;option&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is skew symmetric matrix</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Option (C)&nbsp;is not true.</p></blockquote>",
